        "candidate_id": "C_35897431b1d5ac09_0",
        "edit": "Changed the sensitivity list of the combinational always block from 'always@ (clk)' to 'always@ (clk or d)' so that q updates whenever d changes, matching the expected combinational behavior instead of latching only on clk edges.",
